[review] ### Summary
[review] This PR fixes a bug (#191839) where `trace_dependencies()` unconditionally cleared the caller's profiling callback via `sys.setprofile(None)` in its `finally` block. The fix captures the pre-existing profile with `sys.getprofile()` before installing its own `record_used_modules` callback and restores the captured value in `finally`. Two regression tests cover both the success and exception paths. The change is minimal, correct, and well-tested.
[review] 
